  "prefLabel": "He-C 1001.02 Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 1001.02 Definitions.\n\n(a) “Commission” means the opioid abatement trust fund advisory commission.\n\n(b) “Commissioner” means the commissioner of the department of health and human services.\n\n(c) “Department” means the department of health and human services.\n\n(d) “Trust fund” means the opioid abatement trust fund established in the state treasury pursuant to RSA 126-A:83, I.\n\nSource. #13396, eff 6-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c1000.html"
